    {
      "capabilityId": "es-editions.licensing",
      "disposition": "deferred",
      "qualification": "The editions overview places core detection, Exposure Analytics, Detection Studio and TIM in Essentials, with native SOAR and UEBA in Premier. The 8.8 licensing page requires an underlying Platform license and adds no ingestion capacity. It states 30-day Essentials and 90-day Premier trials, paid-Essentials reversion, expiry limitations, the search-head-cluster display exception and a Cloud Connected Premier trial UI showing Essentials despite continuing connectivity. Pricing model headings do not establish eligibility for every ES deployment. Contract entitlement, activity-model deployment scope, pairing and account activation remain separate. Both-origin screen, offline HTML and PDF evidence remains incomplete.",
